  "tg.draft_rules": {
   "base_rows": 15,
   "changed_or_lost": 1,
   "added": 1,
   "rebaselined": "D72: NFD-3 to NFD-15 change state from Draft to Scheduled and gain in_force_from 2027-01-04 (Monday 4 January 2027, 00:00 Eastern), after the quarter's last shipment (28 December). Statement, check, value and charge are unchanged; no shipment, charge or other table moves (docs/phase4/d72-world-diff.json). 24 November 2026 (P15): NFD-1's charge moves from $150 per document to $7.50 per carton, $50 minimum per order, the charge of the rule in force (NF-4.2, from DSW's published schedule); statement, check and value are unchanged, and the replay costs failures per order. No document, shipment, charge or other table moves (docs/phase4/nov24-p15-world-diff.json)."
  },
